DESCRIPTION:The church is widely involved in diaconal and charitable effor
 ts throughout our city. Out of respect for the privacy of those that we se
 rve\, though\, many of these activities are not widely publicized. If you 
 have a specific question or concern\, feel free to ask a deacon or come to
  one of the church’s deacon meetings. Portions of the meetings are confi
 dential\, but there is always a time for people to talk and pray with our 
 deacons. Save the Date Learn More
